{"overview":"در مرکز داستان، رئیس پلیس شخصاً مشکل‌دار و به‌طور رسمی تحقیر شده و تیم پلیسی نامتوازن او در نیروی پلیس آنکارا حضور دارد. اگرچه برنامه معمولاً بر قتل‌ها و جرایم هفتگی تمرکز دارد، لایه‌ی زیرین داستان منجر به نبرد نهایی بین بهزاد چ و مقامات و بوروکرات‌های پوسیده‌ی بخش می‌شود.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Centered around a personally troubled, officially discredited police chief and his inharmonious police team in Ankara Police Force. Even though the show usually focuses on murders and other crimes that happens on a weekly basis, the undertone of the story leads to an eventual duel between Behzat Ç. and the rotten department officials and bureaucrats.","tagline_en":"","runtime":65,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":0,"name":"ویژه‌ها","ep":25,"y":null,"poster":"/9c28JQLUCxJAWa7cA0Pf5lXwlYF.jpg"},{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":38,"y":2010,"poster":"/aRqNQ5v2tvZ9ZRAXpYik0JamHkm.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":31,"y":2011,"poster":"/aRqNQ5v2tvZ9ZRAXpYik0JamHkm.jpg"},{"n":3,"name":"فصل 3","ep":27,"y":2012,"poster":"/aRqNQ5v2tvZ9ZRAXpYik0JamHkm.jpg"},{"n":4,"name":"فصل 4","ep":9,"y":2019,"poster":"/aRqNQ5v2tvZ9ZRAXpYik0JamHkm.jpg"}],"episodes":105,"crew":["Serdar Akar"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["TR"],"cast":[{"name":"Erdal Beşikçioğlu","role":"Behzat Ç.","photo":"/dZB4XCpku0y8U7FpJqNAZPF7yWZ.jpg"},{"name":"Canan Ergüder","role":"Savcı Esra Bulut","photo":"/8CCShaweDW2bdvb0dqkf1DIsfvu.jpg"},{"name":"Ege Aydan","role":"Şevket Ç.","photo":"/lkUpiyvdbQeNdpzN4LtbDsuDOHc.jpg"},{"name":"İnanç Konukçu","role":"Hayalet / Sabri Özay","photo":"/weQbZzVD1752dqe8Mu69brogZIG.jpg"},{"name":"Berkan Şal","role":"Akbaba / İsmet Arif Karasu","photo":"/hhxeb3rWZ5vObl9AK695ntiJDaP.jpg"},{"name":"Serdar Orçin","role":"Barbaros Tufan","photo":"/kU6FQa80HXajJfB9uP2G0zq4AuS.jpg"},{"name":"Gökhan Yıkılkan","role":"Muzaffer / Muzo","photo":"/jWNpdd1LLPM3k4ZwDWzOguuVx44.jpg"},{"name":"Eray Eserol","role":"Tahsin Yılmaz","photo":"/VzFnFIDayuQJAyT7xWsK8JWK9Q.jpg"},{"name":"Güven Kıraç","role":"Me